  "error": null,
  "scope": [
    "Published IEEE Annex G example inputs are public noncredential vectors. No live MSK, CAK, KEK, ICK or SAK bytes are read or exported.",
    "The unchanged official ieee802_1x_key.c is included directly in a test translation unit. Original OpenSSL CMAC function bytes are extracted without editing, with normal build includes and TEST_FAIL disabled. The helper confirms both full runtime source files match official archive bytes. The harness tests actual derivation functions with OpenSSL3.5.5 in the pinned authorized runtime image; it does not invoke the already linked hostapd ELF functions directly.",
    "IEEE primary-publication indexed text has the preserved hosting/authenticity caveat. G3 uses the complete p285 Session-ID because its p286 indexed repeat has an odd-length malformed hexadecimal group. Matching vectors establish these finite derivations, not full standard conformance or independent interoperability."
  ]
